    ["DictKey_descriptionText_1"] = "Operation Infinity - A randomized sandbox mission for 1-12 players.\n\nISAF forces are engaged in combat operations across the Caucasus against Erusean forces. Players spawn at Krymsk airbase and use the F10 menu to select difficulty and playtime. The mission then generates a battlefield with appropriate targets.\n\nThis is a sandbox mission with no win condition. Fly, fight, and have fun!",
